From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: musa <musa@local>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 19:21:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] MUSA: route DeepSeek-V4.1 attention through the MUSA paths

- FlashMLA ops come from the MUSA module; decode slices the top-k and SWA
  index rows to the active queries.
- Stream overlaps use stream waits, and prefill above 8192 tokens runs
  serially, as for DeepSeek-V4.
- The compressor score GEMM uses the MUSA fp32-output helper.
- The fp8_ds_mla insert uses the MUSA fused RoPE/KV-insert kernel without
  the per-head q norm.
---
 vllm/models/deepseek_v41/attention.py       | 40 ++++++++++++++++++---
 vllm/models/deepseek_v41/nvidia/flashmla.py | 12 ++++++-
 2 files changed, 46 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/vllm/models/deepseek_v41/attention.py b/vllm/models/deepseek_v41/attention.py
index fa26351..8be6ca3 100644
--- a/vllm/models/deepseek_v41/attention.py
+++ b/vllm/models/deepseek_v41/attention.py
